      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "### One API, three clients\n\nThe backend API served at `:4000` (fronted in production by the edge gateway) is **shared by all three Animaxia client platforms**:\n\n- **Web** — the Next.js app on `:3000`\n- **Mobile app** — `animaxia-mobile`\n- **Desktop app** — `animaxia-desktop`\n\nEvery availability, latency, quota and player panel on this dashboard therefore measures the experience of **all three platforms at once** — a regression here degrades web, mobile and desktop simultaneously. Client-specific issues (rendering, offline caches, device bugs) are not visible in these server-side series and must be chased in the client repos.\n\nMetric contract: `animaxia-ops/metrics/METRICS.md` — SLO definitions: `animaxia-ops/alerts/slo.yaml`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Web / mobile / desktop — shared API",
      "type": "text"
    }
